# Source material for the games in ideas/ — photographs of physical components,
# publishers' rulebooks and card archives. The transcription beside them (the
# rules.md and chips.md files) is the content; these are somebody else's boxed
# game and are not ours to ship.
ideas/**/*.jpg
ideas/**/*.jpeg
ideas/**/*.png
ideas/**/*.webp
ideas/**/*.pdf
ideas/**/*.docx
ideas/**/*.psd

ideas/PDFS/
